  "description": "A comprehensive, enterprise-grade .NET 8.0 client library for the Brevo API (formerly SendinBlue). Features complete support for Email Campaigns, SMS Campaigns, Transactional Emails, Transactional SMS, Contacts Management, External Feeds, and all other Brevo API endpoints. Built with modern C# practices, SOLID principles, comprehensive error handling, and extensive logging support.",
